10
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,750
Hey!

11
00:01:32,833 --> 00:01:33,663
Like right now!

12
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:38,237
You've assembled a powerful deck.

13
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:40,560
What if it's not good enough to win?

14
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,457
There comes a time when
there's nothing left

15
